==Description==
The '''Conserver Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 22 of the regular [[Hexscape Event#Hexscape Event Battle Pass|Hexscape Event Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it costed {{CandyCorns|710 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|74}} ({{Robux|55}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{CandyCorns|7,470 Candy Corns}} or {{Robux|1,566}} ({{Robux|1,179}} for the Black Friday 2024 Sale).

The '''Conserver Nametag''' has red text with a few dark red thunder lines in it and a black with red outline. It has red thorns and a dark red mist behind it.

==Trivia==
*The '''Conserver Nametag''' was made to imitate the [[Conserver]] boss, referencing it.

